---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { href } from "../lib/paths";
---
<Layout title="For students | Kin & Campus" description="A pediatrician in Blacksburg. Refills, sick visits, forms, and a say in who we tell.">
<div class="w ph"><div class="eyebrow">For students</div><h1>Your doctor in town.</h1><p class="lead">If you already take something, we keep it going. If you get sick, you write me. If you want your parents in the loop, we decide that together.</p></div>
<div class="w">
<div class="notes">
<div class="note-row"><h3>Refills</h3><p>Whatever you already take. ADHD medication, an inhaler, something for anxiety. It should not lapse because you moved into a dorm.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>When you're sick</h3><p>Write me. I already know your baseline. We can usually see you the same week, and often the same day.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>The adult parts</h3><p>How to book a visit. When to refill. When a fever is just a fever, and when it isn't.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>Who we tell</h3><p>At 18 the chart is yours. If you want us to call home, we write that down first.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:56px">When students write us</div>
<h2>The usual reasons.</h2>
<div class="notes">
<div class="note-row"><h3>A sick day</h3><p>A fever, a sore throat, an asthma flare. Come in if you need to be seen.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>A refill running out</h3><p>Don't wait until the bottle is empty. We keep the plan going through the semester.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>A form</h3><p>Housing, sports, travel, the immunization packet. Bring it and we'll sign what we can.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>After a break</h3><p>We check whether you are still taking what we prescribed, and whether it still fits.</p></div>
</div>
<p style="margin-top:36px"><a class="btn" href={href("join")}>Reserve a spot</a></p>
</div>
</Layout>
